<title>SOUTH AFRICA: COATES , VALSPAR TALKS STILL ON HOLD.</title>
<headline>COATES , VALSPAR TALKS STILL ON HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coates Brothers Ltd said on Thursday that talks with Valspar Corp on a definitive agreement were unlikely to progress before early 1997.</p>
<p>Coates said on Thursday that no date had been fixed for a resumption of talks.</p>
<p>When discussions resumed in 1997 shareholders would be advised by a cautionary announcement, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
